#. key: amulet
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:amulet"
msgid ""
"An amulet to be worn as jewellery around the neck, charged with arcane powers\n"
"of unknown provenance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Talismanas, skirtas nešioti ant kaklo, įkrautas nežinomos kilmės magiškomis\n"
"galiomis.\n"

#. key: potion
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion"
msgid ""
"An unlabelled flask containing a single dose of unknown liquid.\n"
msgstr ""
"Buteliukas skysčio.\n"

#. key: ring
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring"
msgid ""
"A ring charged with arcane forces of unknown provenance, to be worn as jewellery\n"
"on a finger.\n"
msgstr ""
"Talismanas, įkrautas nežinomos kilmės magiškomis galiomis, skirtas nešioti ant\n"
"piršto.\n"

#. key: scroll
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll"
msgid ""
"A disposable arcane formula inscribed on parchment by a professional scribe or\n"
"sorcerer. Anyone can evoke the power of the arcane formula by reading it out\n"
"loud, but the nature of that power is not a priori apparent.\n"
msgstr ""
"Popieriaus ritinys, padengtas magiškais užrašais.\n"

#. key: staff
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:staff"
msgid ""
"A staff improved with arcane powers of unknown nature.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lazda, sustiprinta nežinomos kilmės magiškomis galiomis.\n"

#. key: wand
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wand"
msgid ""
"An unusually magical sort of stick.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lazda. Galbūt magiška.\n"

#. key: aizul
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:aizul"
msgid ""
"Once the primary guardian serpent of a legendary treasure hoard, she was\n"
"disgraced after thieves looted it while she slept. She seeks to make up for her\n"
"failure by protecting the only treasure the villains overlooked, a single\n"
"precious talisman.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kadaise jis buvo pagrindinis legendinės lobių sankaupos žaltys sergėtojas, bet\n"
"užsitraukė gėdą, kai jam bemiegant, ją išplėšė vagys. Dabar jis šliaužioja po\n"
"požemį, kerštaudamas visiems galimiems plėšikams. Jis yra prityręs burtininkas,\n"
"tačiau artimoje kovoje pavojingas tiek pat, kiek ir jo giminaičiai.\n"

#. key: asmodeus
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:asmodeus"
msgid ""
"Greatest and most cunning of the Lords of Hell, Asmodeus was born when the twin\n"
"fires of greed and treachery first sparked to life within a mortal's heart.\n"
"His hideous body is perpetually wreathed in flame.\n"
msgstr ""
"Vienas archdemonų, gyvenantis Pragaro gelmėse. Jį siaučia liepsnų kamuolys.\n"

#. key: azrael
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:azrael"
msgid ""
"A powerful, belligerent efreet. (Is there any other kind?)\n"
msgstr ""
"Karingas, agresyvus ifritas. (Ar būna kitokių?)\n"

#. key: boris
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:boris"
msgid ""
"An ancient and powerful lich. Like all true liches, Boris is immortal, and will\n"
"regenerate his desiccated skeletal remains even if completely disintegrated.\n"
"The same cannot be said for his many victims over his many centuries, from\n"
"which he collects and channels their dying woes and regrets.\n"
msgstr ""
"Itin senas ir galingas ličas. Kaip ir visi tikri ličai, Borisas yra nemirtingas\n"
"ir gali regeneruoti savo sudžiūvusius ir kaulėtus palaikus net ir visiškai\n"
"jiems suirus. Nors paprastai šis sudėtingas procesas trunka mėnesiais ar netgi\n"
"metais, Borisas jį įvaldė tiek, kad gali atgyti per kelias minutes.\n"

#. key: cerebov
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cerebov"
msgid ""
"A violent and wrathful demon, Cerebov appears as a giant humanoid covered in\n"
"shining golden armour and wielding a huge twisted sword.\n"
msgstr ""
"Rūstus ir smarkus demonas, Cerebovas atrodo lyg milžiniškas žmogus, apsidengęs\n"
"auksiniais šarvais ir laikantis didžiulį suktą kardą rankose.\n"

#. key: chuck
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:chuck"
msgid ""
"Chuck the stone giant loves rocks, the bigger the better! Over the years, he\n"
"has managed to amass quite the collection, including some rare, enchanted ones.\n"
msgstr ""
"Čakas akmens milžinas mėgsta akmenis, kuo didesni, tuo geriau! Laikui bėgant,\n"
"jis sugebėjo sukaupti gan nemažą kolekciją, įskaitant ir keletą retų, užburtų\n"
"akmenų.\n"

#. key: crazy yiuf
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:crazy yiuf"
msgid ""
"A withered old gnoll with a long silver beard, wielding a quarterstaff and\n"
"wearing a cloak. He looks like a figure from mythology! Wait, is his beard held\n"
"on to his ears with hooks?\n"
msgstr ""
"Senas ir sudžiūvęs gnolis ilga sidabriška barzda, laikantis lazdą ir vilkintis\n"
"apsiaustą. Jis atrodo lyg mitinė asmenybė! Pala, ar jo barzda kabliukais\n"
"užkabinta ant jo ausų?\n"

#. key: dispater
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dispater"
msgid ""
"Greatest and most ruthless of the Lords of Hell, Dispater was born when first an\n"
"iron sword drank mortal blood. They despise mortal vanities, the pursuit of\n"
"‘reason’ and ‘beauty’ - the only art they enjoy is the art of war.\n"
msgstr ""
"Geležinio Dis Miesto valdovas.\n"

#. key: dissolution
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dissolution"
msgid ""
"The Pits of Slime used to be a thriving civilisation, and Dissolution was the\n"
"prophet of their god. When the city was overtaken by its current residents,\n"
"only Dissolution survived, for they alone turned faithfully to the Slime God.\n"
"Dissolution became a tremendous mass of acidic ooze, yet retained their\n"
"intelligence. They are filled with hatred for anything that can hold a form.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gleivių Olos kadaise buvo klestinti civilizacija, o Beformis buvo jų dievybės\n"
"pranašas. Kai miestą užėmė dabartiniai jo gyventojai, išliko tik Beformis, nes\n"
"jis vienintelis pradėjo ištikimai garbinti Gleivių Dievybę. Beformis pavirto\n"
"milžiniška mase rūgštingo dumblo, tačiau išlaikė savo protą. Jis pilnas\n"
"neapykantos viskam, kas turi formą.\n"

#. key: donald
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:donald"
msgid ""
"{{\n"
"    local descript = \"An adventurer just like you, trying to find the Orb.\"\n"
"\n"
"    if you.race() ~= \"Merfolk\" and you.race() ~= \"Octopode\" then\n"
"        descript = descript .. \" Unlike you, and d\"\n"
"    else\n"
"        descript = descript .. \" D\"\n"
"    end\n"
"\n"
"    descript = descript .. \"espite his hatred of it, he takes to water \" ..\n"
"                           \"like a fowl.\"\n"
"\n"
"    return descript\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"{{\n"
"    local descript = \"Nuotykių ieškotojas kaip ir jūs, bandantis surasti\n"
"Rutulį.\"\n"
"\n"
"    if you.race() ~= \"Merfolk\" and you.race() ~= \"Octopode\" then\n"
"        descript = descript .. \" Ne taip, kaip jūs, ir n\"\n"
"    else\n"
"        descript = descript .. \" N\"\n"
"    end\n"
"\n"
"    descript = descript .. \"epaisant to, kad jis nemėgsta vandens, jį ten \" ..\n"
"                           \"nenumaldomai traukia.\"\n"
"\n"
"    return descript\n"
"}}\n"

#. key: dowan
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dowan"
msgid ""
"A beautiful but vain deep elf with an aptitude for magic and little else. His\n"
"skills are the perfect complement of his twin sister Duvessa's fighting prowess.\n"
"In search of more powerful spells, he journeys to the surface with his sister.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gražus, tačiau tuščiagarbis elfas, gabus magijai ir beveik niekam kitam. Jo\n"
"gabumai puikiai papildo jo sesers dvynės Diuvesos kovos išmanymą.\n"

#. key: duvessa
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:duvessa"
msgid ""
"A plain-looking deep elven fighter who is technically brilliant in many forms of\n"
"combat, but over-confident because of it. She is complemented by the magical\n"
"skills of her twin brother, Dowan. She journeys to the surface to challenge\n"
"its greatest champions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Paprastai atrodanti elfų karė, nuostabiai įvaldžiusi daugybės kovos rūšių\n"
"techniką, tačiau dėl to pernelyg savim pasitikinti. Ją papildo jos brolio\n"
"dvynio Dovano magijos įgūdžiai.\n"

#. key: edmund
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:edmund"
msgid ""
"A jealous sibling of Sigmund (indeed, the youngest of nine brothers). He has\n"
"none of Sigmund's skills in magic, but makes up for it with his skills in\n"
"fighting and a canny head for money. He is eager to prove his superiority by\n"
"killing hapless adventurers with his expensive flail and quick wit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pavydus Sigmundo brolis (iš tikro, jauniausias iš devynių brolių). Ne taip kaip\n"
"Sigmundas, jis visiškai neišmano magijos, tačiau tą atperka jo kovos įgūdžiai\n"
"ir gebėjimas prasimanyti pinigų. Jis nekantrauja įrodyti savo pranašumą žudant\n"
"nelaimėlius nuotykių ieškotojus savuoju brangiai kainavusiu spragilu ir žvitriu\n"
"sąmoju.\n"

#. key: ereshkigal
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ereshkigal"
msgid ""
"Greatest and most inexorable of the Lords of Hell, Ereshkigal was born when\n"
"first a mortal breathed her last. Noiselessly she laughs at lives cut short and\n"
"loved ones separated by untimely death, enwreathed in the silence of the grave.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bauginanti išperų išpera, valdanti mirtiną požeminį Tartaro pasaulį.\n"

#. key: erolcha
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:erolcha"
msgid ""
"An especially cunning ogre-mage.\n"
msgstr ""
"Itin sukta žmogėdra-burtininkė.\n"

#. key: eustachio
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:eustachio"
msgid ""
"An apprentice summoner with a flowing moustache. He has funny ideas about\n"
"honour.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pradedantysis iššaukėjas ilgais ūsais. Jis turi keistą supratimą apie garbę.\n"

#. key: frances
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:frances"
msgid ""
"A stout warrior who once bested a powerful lord of Pandemonium in combat,\n"
"gaining control over the demon's realm and thanes. The battle left her with a\n"
"deep facial scar, one that she carries as a badge of honour rather than a\n"
"symbol of shame.\n"
msgstr ""
"Stambi kovotoja, kadaise kovoje įveikusi galingą Pandemoniumo valdovą, taip\n"
"paveldėdama jo karaliją ir didikus.\n"

#. key: frederick
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:frederick"
msgid ""
"A svelte fighter-mage with a gold-rimmed monocle, a keen sense of tradition,\n"
"and the blood of the gods running through his veins. He's here looking for a\n"
"worthy opponent, but he's yet to find one.\n"
msgstr ""
"Manieringas karys-magas su monokliu auksiniais apvadais, ieškantis tinkamo ir\n"
"prideramo priešininko. Jūs greičiausiai netinkate.\n"

#. key: gloorx vloq
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:gloorx vloq"
msgid ""
"A shadowy figure clothed in profound darkness.\n"
msgstr ""
"Miglota figūra apsupta glūdžios tamsos\n"

#. key: ijyb
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ijyb"
msgid ""
"A small and shrewd goblin inventor, wearing blue rags coated in soot.\n"
"She claims dominion over this level of the dungeon; trespassers will find\n"
"themselves on the business end of a homemade wand.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mažas ir suktas goblinas, dėvintis keletą mėlynų skudurų. Šį požemio lygį jis\n"
"laiko savo valdomis, į kurias įžengus baudžiama mirtimi.\n"

#. key: joseph
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:joseph"
msgid ""
"Looks like a mercenary in a stupid-looking hat.\n"
msgstr ""
"Atrodo kaip samdomas karys.\n"

#. key: xtahua
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:xtahua"
msgid ""
"An ancient and mighty dragon.\n"
msgstr ""
"Senas ir galingas drakonas.\n"

#. key: brimstone fiend
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:brimstone fiend"
msgid ""
"A huge and powerful demon wreathed in damnation, with great scaly wings. It is\n"
"one of the most fearsome denizens of any of the Hells.\n"
msgstr ""
"Milžiniškas ir galingas demonas dideliais žvynuotais sparnais, apsuptas pragaro\n"
"liepsnų. Vienas labiausiai bauginančių visų Pragarų gyventojų.\n"

#. key: executioner
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:executioner"
msgid ""
"A horribly powerful and swift demon, its shape obscured by a cloud of swirling\n"
"scythe-like blades.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siaubingai galingas ir greitas demonas. Jo figūrą temdo sūkuriuojančių panašių\n"
"į dalgio ašmenų debesis.\n"

#. key: elven halls
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:elven halls"
msgid ""
"The Elven Halls are home to the deep elves, a race that turned their backs on\n"
"the sun long ago. Their halls are filled with riches, but a deadly welcome\n"
"awaits any would-be robbers. In their long seclusion, the deep elves have\n"
"perfected dark sorceries of a power the orcs can only dream of!\n"
msgstr ""
"Nors dauguma elfų niekados nesikeltų į tokias niūrias požemines sales, kaip\n"
"šitos, gilumų elfai tą ir padarė. Jų menės kupinos lobių, tačiau prašalaičiai\n"
"turėtų atminti legendinius šios giminės magijos sugebėjimus.\n"
"\n"
"Elfų Salės yra trijų lygių gylio.\n"

#. key: lair
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lair"
msgid ""
"Most adventurers find the Lair of Beasts to be an exciting change of climate.\n"
"And indeed, there is something to be said about getting gored, mauled and eaten\n"
"rather than sliced, burnt or stabbed.\n"
"\n"
"The Lair contains the entrances to one of the Swamp or the Shoals, one of the\n"
"Snake Pit or the Spider Nest, and to the Pits of Slime.\n"
msgstr ""
"Daugumai nuotykių ieškotojų Žvėrių Irštva yra jaudinantis aplinkos pakeitimas.\n"
"Ir iš tikrųjų, kur kas geriau būti užbadytam, sumaitotam ir suėstam, o ne\n"
"papjautam, sudegintam ar nudurtam.\n"
"\n"
"Irštva yra aštuonių lygių gylio ir turi laiptus į dar tris atšakas.\n"

#. key: sewer
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sewer"
msgid ""
"Every inhabited place needs to dispose of its waste products. The Dungeon too\n"
"has its stinking sewers and drains, full of filthy water and ignored by most\n"
"but used as hideaways by the disgusting and the desperate. Old tales speak of\n"
"dangerous creatures stalking through the foul-smelling green water, preying on\n"
"each other without mercy. The tales also allude to valuable items accidentally\n"
"washed into the drainage tunnels, forgotten and left to grow mouldy in the damp\n"
"caverns.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kiekvienoje gyvenvietėje atsiranda ir kanalizacijos vamzdžiai ir drenažai,\n"
"daugumos ignoruojami, tačiau priebėga likusiems. Seni pasakojimai byloja apie\n"
"pavojingus gyvius, besimaudančius šlykščiai smirdančiame žaliame vandenyje ir\n"
"negailestingai vienas kitą medžiojančius. Pasakojimai taip pat užsimena apie\n"
"vertingus daiktus, paliktus bebaimių ir nesėkmingų lankytojų, pelijančius\n"
"drėgnuose urvuose.\n"

#. key: volcano
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:volcano"
msgid ""
"Built from enormous blocks of obsidian, the volcano's sweltering chambers may\n"
"once have served as a temple to some strange deity, or perhaps the dwelling of\n"
"a mighty fire giant. The air shimmers with oppressive heat, and the dull roar\n"
"of the volcano's heart never ceases.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ši patalpa, pastatyta iš milžiniškų obsidiano luitų, kadaise galėjo būti\n"
"šventykla kokiai nors keistai dievybei, arba, galbūt, galingo ugnies milžino\n"
"buveinė.\n"

#. key: fighting
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fighting"
msgid ""
"Fighting skill increases your accuracy and damage in physical combat, and\n"
"also increases your maximum health.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kovos įgūdis didina taiklumą ir žalą artimoje kovoje, ir taip pat padidina\n"
"gyvybės taškų maksimumą.\n"

#. key: throwing
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:throwing"
msgid ""
"Training Throwing will make thrown weapons (such as javelins) more accurate\n"
"and damaging. It also makes certain magical darts more likely to have an\n"
"effect.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mėtymo įgūdžių treniravimas padaro mėtomus ginklus (kaip ietis) ir spjaudykles\n"
"efektyvesnius. Ypatingai šie įgūdžiai padidiną tikimybę, kad grįžtamieji\n"
"ginklai sugrįš, ir kad kai kurios magiškos adatos, iššautos spjaudykle, turės\n"
"poveikį.\n"
"\n"
"Įgūdžiai Mėtyme palengvina mokymasi naudoti Svaidykles, ir atvirkščiai.\n"

#. key: armour
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:armour"
msgid ""
"Armour skill multiplies the AC gained from wearing armour of all kinds, both\n"
"from body armour and cloaks, gloves, etc. It also slightly lessens penalties\n"
"to spellcasting and ranged weapon speed from heavy armour.\n"
msgstr ""
"Šarvų įgūdžiai padidina ŠK, gautą dėvint sunkius šarvus, ir taip pat padeda\n"
"sumenkinti sunkių šarvų trukdžius artimoje kovoje ir naudojant magiją.\n"

#. key: dodging
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dodging"
msgid ""
"The Dodging skill will affect your chance of dodging an attack, be it melee,\n"
"ranged or magical. Certain types of attack cannot be dodged, however, such as\n"
"enchantments (which must be resisted with willpower) and explosions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Išsisukinėjimo įgūdžiai įtakoja tikimybę išvengti atakos, nepaisant to ar ji\n"
"artimos kovos, per atstumą ar magiška. Kai kurių atakų tipų negalima išvengti.\n"
"kaip pavyzdžiui sustiprinimai (kuriems reikia atsispirti) ir sprogimai.\n"

#. key: shields
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shields"
msgid ""
"A high Shields skill helps you block melee attacks or projectiles (both magical\n"
"and non-magical) with your equipped shield, and reduces their penalty to your\n"
"evasion, attack speed and spellcasting success.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aukšto lygio Skydų įgūdžiai padeda blokuoti artimas arba tolimas (magiškas ir\n"
"ne) atakas naudojant laikomą (arba magišką) skydą. Kai kurios atakos, tokios\n"
"kaip pareinantys žaibai, negali būti blokuojamos.\n"

#. key: unarmed combat
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:unarmed combat"
msgid ""
"Being skilled in Unarmed Combat increases your accuracy, damage and attack\n"
"speed in melee combat when barehanded.\n"
msgstr ""
"Įgūdžiai Beginklėje kovoje padidina taiklumą, žalą ir greitį artimoje kovoje,\n"
"kovojant plikomis rankomis. Jie taip pat leidžia kartais smūgiuoti antrąja\n"
"ranka atliekant papildomą ataką artimoje kovoje, su sąlyga, kad ta ranka yra\n"
"laisva.\n"

#. key: cmd_rest verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_rest verbose"
msgid ""
"Rests while your health and magic regenerate. Resting is interrupted as soon\n"
"as a hostile monster comes into view. If health and magic are both already\n"
"full, resting will wait for 100 turns.\n"
msgstr ""
"Praleisti iki 100 ėjimų atgauti sveikatai, atsistatyti maną ir/arba paieškai.\n"
"Poilsis nutraukiamas, kai tik pasirodo priešiškas monstras.\n"

#. key: cmd_explore
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_explore"
msgid ""
"Autoexplore the current level\n"
msgstr ""
"Automatiškai tyrinėti dabartinį lygį\n"

#. key: cmd_explore verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_explore verbose"
msgid ""
"Automatically explores the current level, collecting items on the way.\n"
"Exploration stops as soon as a hostile monster comes into view, or when you\n"
"encounter new items or features.\n"
msgstr ""
"Leidžia jūsų veikėjui autopilotu keliauti link neištirtų dabartinio lygio plotų\n"
"ir pakeliui rinkti automatiškai pakeliamus daiktus. Keliavimas sustoja kai tik\n"
"pasirodo priešiškas monstras, taip pat norint pranešti apie rastus daiktus ar\n"
"ypatybes.\n"

#. key: cmd_interlevel_travel
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_interlevel_travel"
msgid ""
"Travel to distant levels\n"
msgstr ""
"Keliauti į tolimus lygius\n"

#. key: cmd_interlevel_travel verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_interlevel_travel verbose"
msgid ""
"Automatically travels to a chosen level or branch. Travel is interrupted by\n"
"monsters coming into view.\n"
msgstr ""
"Automatiškai keliauti į tolimus lygius. Keliavimas nutraukiamas pasirodančių\n"
"baisūnų.\n"

#. key: cmd_use_ability
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_use_ability"
msgid ""
"Use divine, innate or evokable abilities\n"
msgstr ""
"Naudoti dieviškus arba įgimtus gebėjimus\n"

#. key: cmd_search_stashes
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_search_stashes"
msgid ""
"Search for items/features\n"
msgstr ""
"Ieškoti daiktų/ypatybių.\n"

#. key: cmd_search_stashes verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_search_stashes verbose"
msgid ""
"Searches for items or features seen elsewhere, and allows you to travel to\n"
"their location.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ieškoti kažkur matytų daiktų arba ypatybių ir tada link jų keliauti.\n"

#. key: cmd_replay_messages
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_replay_messages"
msgid ""
"Reread recent messages\n"
msgstr ""
"Iš naujo perskaityti paskutinius pranešimus\n"

#. key: cmd_resists_screen
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_resists_screen"
msgid ""
"Display character overview\n"
msgstr ""
"Parodyti veikėjo apžvalgą\n"

#. key: cmd_resists_screen verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_resists_screen verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays an overview of your current resistances, abilities, equipment and\n"
"attributes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Parodo informaciją apie žinomus atsparumus, gebėjimus, aprangos statistiką ir\n"
"t.t.\n"

#. key: cmd_display_overmap
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_overmap"
msgid ""
"Display dungeon overview\n"
msgstr ""
"Parodyti požemio planą\n"

#. key: cmd_display_overmap verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_overmap verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays an overview of dungeon branch locations, discovered altars, shops and\n"
"level annotations.\n"
msgstr ""
"Parodo iki šiol aptiktų įėjimų į atšakas, parduotuvių ir kitų ypatybių vietas.\n"

#. key: cmd_display_religion
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_religion"
msgid ""
"Display religious status\n"
msgstr ""
"Parodyti religinę būseną\n"

#. key: cmd_display_religion verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_religion verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays your god's likes and dislikes, conduct, and your current religious\n"
"standing and divine abilities.\n"
msgstr ""
"Parodo tavo dievybės polinkius ir nemėgstamus dalykus, elgimasį, ttavo\n"
"dabartinę religinę padėtį ir dieviškus gebėjimus.\n"

#. key: cmd_display_mutations
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_mutations"
msgid ""
"Display mutations\n"
msgstr ""
"Parodyti mutacijas\n"

#. key: cmd_display_skills
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_skills"
msgid ""
"Manage skills\n"
msgstr ""
"Tvarkyti įgūdžius\n"

#. key: cmd_display_character_status
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_character_status"
msgid ""
"Display character status\n"
msgstr ""
"Parodyti veikėjo būseną\n"

#. key: cmd_display_character_status verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_character_status verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays details on your current movement speed, attack speed, stealth, magic\n"
"resistance, and any currently active enchantments or status effects.\n"
msgstr ""
"Parodo aktyvius sustiprinimus ir kelis kitus dalykus.\n"

#. key: cmd_display_known_objects
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_known_objects"
msgid ""
"List discovered item types\n"
msgstr ""
"Atrastų daiktų tipų sąrašas\n"

#. key: cmd_save_game_now
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_save_game_now"
msgid ""
"Save and exit\n"
msgstr ""
"Išsaugoti ir išeiti\n"

#. key: cmd_save_game_now verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_save_game_now verbose"
msgid ""
"Saves the game for later and exits. Once you resume the game, the save file is\n"
"deleted again.\n"
msgstr ""
"Išsaugo žaidimą ir išeina. Pratęsus žaidimą, išsaugota byla ištrinama.\n"

#. key: cmd_edit_player_tile
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_edit_player_tile"
msgid ""
"Modify the player tile\n"
msgstr ""
"Pakeisti žaidėjo paveikslėlį\n"

#. key: cmd_edit_player_tile verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_edit_player_tile verbose"
msgid ""
"Allows you to modify the equipment and species tile displayed in the player\n"
"doll.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pakeisti aprangos ir rūšies paveikslėlį rodomą ant žaidėjo.\n"

#. key: cmd_display_commands
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_commands"
msgid ""
"Game help\n"
msgstr ""
"Žaidimo pagalba\n"

#. key: cmd_display_commands verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_commands verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays a list of commands.\n"
msgstr ""
"Komandų, pasirinkimų ir t.t. sąrašas\n"

#. key: cmd_autofight
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_autofight"
msgid ""
"Hit the closest monster\n"
msgstr ""
"Smogti artimiausiam monstrui\n"

#. key: cmd_autofight verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_autofight verbose"
msgid ""
"Moves towards the closest hostile monster, or attacks an adjacent monster with\n"
"your current weapon.\n"
msgstr ""
"Judėti link artimiausio priešiško monstro ir pulti jį su rankose laikomu\n"
"ginklu.\n"

#. key: cmd_autofight_nomove
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_autofight_nomove"
msgid ""
"Hit an adjacent monster\n"
msgstr ""
"Smogti gretimam monstrui\n"

#. key: cmd_autofight_nomove verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_autofight_nomove verbose"
msgid ""
"Attacks an adjacent monster with your current weapon.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pulti šalia esantį monstrą su rankose laikomu ginklu.\n"

#. key: cmd_wait
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_wait"
msgid ""
"Wait a single turn\n"
msgstr ""
"Palūkėti vieną ėjimą\n"

#. key: cmd_wait verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_wait verbose"
msgid ""
"Spends a single turn waiting and resting.\n"
msgstr ""
"Praleisti ėjimą laukiant ir ilsintis.\n"

#. key: cmd_display_inventory
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_inventory"
msgid ""
"Display the contents of your inventory\n"
msgstr ""
"Rodyti inventoriaus turinį\n"

#. key: cmd_display_inventory verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_inventory verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays the contents of your inventory.\n"
msgstr ""
"Rodyti inventoriaus turinį\n"

#. key: cmd_memorise_spell
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_memorise_spell"
msgid ""
"Memorise spell\n"
msgstr ""
"Įsiminti burtažodį\n"

#. key: cmd_drop
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_drop"
msgid ""
"Drop items\n"
msgstr ""
"Numesti daiktus\n"

#. key: cmd_drop verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_drop verbose"
msgid ""
"Drops one or more items that you are currently holding.\n"
msgstr ""
"Numesti vieną ar daugiau iš šiuo metu laikomų daiktų\n"

#. key: cmd_map_next_level
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_next_level"
msgid ""
"Down one level\n"
msgstr ""
"Žeimiau vienu lygiu\n"

#. key: cmd_map_next_level verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_next_level verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays the next deeper level.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tyrinėti sekantį gilesnį lygį\n"

#. key: cmd_map_prev_level
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_prev_level"
msgid ""
"Up one level\n"
msgstr ""
"Aukščiau vienu lygiu\n"

#. key: cmd_map_prev_level verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_prev_level verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays the next higher level.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tyrinėti sekantį aukštesnį lygį\n"

#. key: cmd_map_goto_level
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_goto_level"
msgid ""
"Go to level\n"
msgstr ""
"Eiti į lygį\n"

#. key: cmd_map_find_upstair
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_find_upstair"
msgid ""
"Find stairs up\n"
msgstr ""
"Rasti laiptus aukštyn\n"

#. key: cmd_map_find_downstair
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_find_downstair"
msgid ""
"Find stairs down\n"
msgstr ""
"Rasti laiptus žemyn\n"

#. key: cmd_map_find_portal
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_find_portal"
msgid ""
"Find shops and portals\n"
msgstr ""
"Rasti parduotuves ir portalus\n"

#. key: cmd_map_find_trap
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_find_trap"
msgid ""
"Find traps\n"
msgstr ""
"Rasti spąstus\n"

#. key: cmd_map_find_altar
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_find_altar"
msgid ""
"Find altars\n"
msgstr ""
"Rasti altorius\n"

#. key: cmd_map_find_stash
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_find_stash"
msgid ""
"Find stash\n"
msgstr ""
"Surasti slėptuvę\n"

#. key: deep elf
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:deep elf"
msgid ""
"Deep Elves have a strong affinity for all kinds of magic, but are very fragile.\n"
"They regenerate magical power rapidly.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gabiausias magijai, bet pats silpniausias elfas.\n"

#. key: demigod
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:demigod"
msgid ""
"Demigods refuse to worship any god, but make up for this with divine attributes\n"
"and high reserves of health and magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jie niekada neseks dievybės, bet pusdieviai tai kompensuoja dieviškomis\n"
"savybėmis ir sveikata.\n"

#. key: demonspawn
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:demonspawn"
msgid ""
"Demonspawn are half human, half demon. They acquire strong demonic mutations as\n"
"they grow.\n"
msgstr ""
"Velnio išpera yra pusiau žmogus, pusiau demonas. Augdami jie įgyja stiprias\n"
"mutacijas.\n"

#. key: draconian
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:draconian"
msgid ""
"Draconians are versatile hybrids. They mature when reaching level 7 and develop\n"
"a colour.\n"
msgstr ""
"Drakošai yra įvairiapusiški mišrūnai. Jie subręsta pasiekę 7 lygį ir įgauna\n"
"spalvą.\n"

#. key: felid
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:felid"
msgid ""
"Felids are many-lived sentient cats. They cannot use armour or weapons.\n"
msgstr ""
"Šie katinai turi sąmonę, bet yra nepajėgūs valdyti sudėtingesnių daiktų, šarvų\n"
"ir ginklų.\n"

#. key: human
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:human"
msgid ""
"Humans are natural explorers. Discovering new places refreshes and invigorates them.\n"
"They are otherwise completely average.\n"
msgstr ""
"Paprastas ir vidutiniškas.\n"

#. key: tengu
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:tengu"
msgid ""
"Tengu are bird-people who love to fight, both with weapons and spells. They are\n"
"fragile but agile, and eventually learn to fly.\n"
msgstr ""
"Paukščiažmogiai, mylintys kautynes, tiek ginklais, tiek magija. Jie yra gana\n"
"gležni, bet ilgainiui išmoksta skraidyti.\n"

#. key: merfolk
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:merfolk"
msgid ""
"Half fish, half human, Merfolk are citizens of both water and land. They are\n"
"strong combatants, and adept at using magic to assist in battle.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pusiau žuvys, pusiau žmonės, vandeniai yra ir vandens ir žemės gyventojai.\n"

#. key: minotaur
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:minotaur"
msgid ""
"Minotaurs are large muscular humans with bovine heads. They excel at all forms\n"
"of close and ranged combat.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dideli raumeningi žmonės su jaučio galvomis. Jie yra labai pajėgūs artimoje ir\n"
"tolimoje kovoje.\n"

#. key: mummy
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:mummy"
msgid ""
"Compelled to walk by an ancient curse, Mummies have innate faith and are adept\n"
"at Necromancy, but learn other skills very slowly. They cannot drink potions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nemirėlio figūra padengta raiščiais ir balzamuota, seno prakeiksmo priversta\n"
"vaikščioti.\n"

#. key: naga
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:naga"
msgid ""
"Nagas are hybrids: human from the waist up, with a snake-like tail instead of\n"
"legs. They move very slowly but are naturally resilient.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mišrūnas — žmogus su žvynuotu ir raumeningu liemeniu, pereinančiu į gyvatės\n"
"uodegą.\n"

#. key: octopode
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:octopode"
msgid ""
"Octopodes are a species of amphibious cephalopods. They can wear eight rings,\n"
"but almost no armour fits them.\n"
msgstr ""
"Amfibinių galvokojų rūšis. Jie gali dėvėti aštuonis žiedus, bet jiems netinka\n"
"beveik jokie šarvai.\n"

#. key: spriggan
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:spriggan"
msgid ""
"Very small, very frail and very fast, Spriggans are highly competent stabbers\n"
"and spellcasters.\n"
msgstr ""
"Labai maži, labai gležni ir labai greiti. Spriganai yra labai kompetetingi kai\n"
"reikia ką nors nudurti, taip pat yra labai gabūs burtininkai.\n"

#. key: troll
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:troll"
msgid ""
"Trolls are monstrous creatures with powerful claws. They regenerate health\n"
"rapidly.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dideli gyvuliai, pasiruošę savo nagais sužaloti bet ką, niekada negalvojantys\n"
"du kartus. Jie visada alkani.\n"

#. key: air elementalist
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:air elementalist"
msgid ""
"Air Elementalists have learned the Shock spell. Their electrical magic can harm\n"
"groups of foes, while their air spells assist in fighting or fleeing enemies.\n"
msgstr ""
"Oro burtininkai moka Šoko burtažodį. Vėliau jų turima Oro knyga suteikia jiems\n"
"lankstumą išgyvenimui.\n"

#. key: artificer
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:artificer"
msgid ""
"Artificers start with a few magic wands and a club. They'll need to find better\n"
"weapons and armour before their wands run out.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mechanikai pradeda su keliais magiškais įrenginiais ir moka jais naudotis.\n"

#. key: berserker
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:berserker"
msgid ""
"Berserkers believe in Trog, the magic-hating god of frenzy. Not much can stop a\n"
"raging berserker early on, apart from hubris.\n"
msgstr ""
"Berserkeriai tiki Trogą, nekenčiantį magijos įtūžio dievą. Nedaug kas pradžioje\n"
"gali sustabdyti įsisiautėjusį berserkerį, nebent puikybė.\n"

#. key: chaos knight
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:chaos knight"
msgid ""
"Chaos Knights are playthings of the unpredictable Xom, and are subject to the\n"
"god's constantly changing moods.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sumaišties riteriai yra neprognozuojamo Xom žaisliukai ir priklauso nuo jo\n"
"nuolat besimainančių nuotaikų.\n"

#. key: conjurer
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:conjurer"
msgid ""
"Conjurers begin with the Magic Dart spell, and can learn other non-elemental\n"
"spells to reliably blast their foes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Magai problemas sprendžia naikinančiais Būrimų knygos burtais.\n"

#. key: earth elementalist
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:earth elementalist"
msgid ""
"Earth Elementalists know the Sandblast spell, and can later learn more earthen\n"
"spells suitable for subtle stabbing or brute-force blasting.\n"
msgstr ""
"Žemės burtininkai moka Smėlio Užtaiso burtažodį ir nešiojasi akmenis burto\n"
"galiai sustiprinti. Daugiau žemės burtų yra jų turimoje Geomantijos knygoje.\n"

#. key: enchanter
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:enchanter"
msgid ""
"Enchanters know a variety of Hexes that can incapacitate their foes, and are\n"
"equipped with an enchanted dagger and potions of invisibility.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kerėtojai naudojasi burtažodžiais, kad sustiprėtų kovai patys arba išvestų iš\n"
"rikiuotės kitus. Taip pat jie pradeda su geros kokybės strėlytėmis.\n"

#. key: fire elementalist
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:fire elementalist"
msgid ""
"Fire Elementalists have learned the Foxfire spell. Their other starting spells\n"
"are likewise focused on fiery and explosive destruction.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ugnies burtininkai pradeda su Liepsnų knyga ir moka Ugnies Liežuvio burtažodį.\n"
"Kiti burtažodžiai jų knygoje taip pat skirti naikinimui.\n"

#. key: gladiator
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:gladiator"
msgid ""
"Gladiators are ready for the arena with light armour, a weapon of their choice,\n"
"and a few throwing weapons and nets.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gladiatoriai yra pasirengę arenai su lengvais šarvais, skydu, tinklais ir pačių\n"
"pasirinktu ginklu.\n"

#. key: hedge wizard
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:hedge wizard"
msgid ""
"Hedge Wizards are magic generalists, good at using a wide variety of tools to\n"
"frustrate their foes and gain an edge in the battlefield.\n"
msgstr ""
"Burtininkai pradeda su Smulkiosios Magijos knyga, turinčia pluoštą burtažodžių.\n"
"Jų magijos atsargos diesnės nei bet kurios kitos profesijos.\n"

#. key: hunter
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:hunter"
msgid ""
"Hunters carry a shortbow, light armour and a scroll of butterflies.\n"
msgstr ""
"Medžiotojai gali pulti iš atstumo, nesikliaudami varginančia magija.\n"

#. key: ice elementalist
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:ice elementalist"
msgid ""
"Ice Elementalists begin with the Freeze spell. Their later spells provide strong\n"
"offence and defence, but may restrict their movement.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ledo burtininkai pradeda su Šalčio knyga ir Šaldymo burtažodžiu. Kiti knygos\n"
"burtažodžiai yra ganėtinai įvairūs.\n"

#. key: monk
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:monk"
msgid ""
"Monks start with a simple weapon of their choice, an orb of light, and a potion\n"
"of divine ambrosia, and gain additional piety with the first god they worship.\n"
msgstr ""
"Vienuoliai yra pasiruošę imtis su bet kuo požemyje, dėvedami tik mantiją ir\n"
"naudodami savo kūną.\n"

#. key: necromancer
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:necromancer"
msgid ""
"Necromancers start out with the Soul Splinter spell. Eventually, they can turn\n"
"the dead into allies and use the life force of the living to restore themselves.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nekromantai yra burtininkai specializuojantys mirties magijos taikyme. Jie\n"
"pradeda su Skausmo burtažodžiu.\n"

#. key: wanderer
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:wanderer"
msgid ""
"Wanderers start with random equipment and skills.\n"
msgstr ""
"Klajokliai pradeda su atsitiktiniais reikmenimis ir įgūdžiais.\n"

#. key: warper
#: dat/descript/backgrounds.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:warper"
msgid ""
"Warpers start with a weapon of their choice, a scroll of blinking, darts of\n"
"disjunction, and some Translocation spells in their library.\n"
msgstr ""
"Keliautojai Erdve pradeda su pačių pasirinktu ginklu ir Mirktelėjimo ritiniu.\n"
"Jie gali išmokti burtažodžius iš Erdvinių Perkėlimų knygos.\n"

